# Deployment procedure

1. After any receipts-app code change, update the local app at `http://localhost:3001` only (`npm run dev`). Do not deploy to Hostinger.
2. Wait. The user reviews on local, then says **commit and deploy**.
3. On those words, commit the app change and push it to GitHub `origin/master` (`https://github.com/tigeryanggit/motto_receipt.git`) before the production deploy. Leave out secrets, sample images under `Receipts/`, and `*.traineddata`.
4. Then deploy that same code to Hostinger only. Read `.cursor/skills/hostinger-vps-deploy/SKILL.md`. Do not deploy to Zeabur.

Production deploy updates this application's code only. Do not change Caddy, DNS, the booking app, the investment app, or PostgreSQL unless the user explicitly asks.
